{
  "language": "zh",
  "duration": 334.1598125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.08,
      "text": "这条视频告诉你该怎么做读书博书"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 3.08,
      "end": 5.12,
      "text": "没有可以读书博书更好的塞造了"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 5.12,
      "end": 7.8,
      "text": "可是我们大部分人的就做的读书"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 7.8,
      "end": 8.96,
      "text": "什么样的"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 8.96,
      "end": 10.24,
      "text": "都是错的"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 10.24,
      "end": 12.2,
      "text": "今天就有"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 12.2,
      "end": 13.04,
      "text": "我前两天有人问"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 13.04,
      "end": 15.2,
      "text": "我能够"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 15.2,
      "end": 16.84,
      "text": "读书博监读书"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 16.84,
      "end": 18.48,
      "text": "然后我可不可以读了"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 18.48,
      "end": 19.72,
      "text": "那我怎么面线"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 19.72,
      "end": 21.8,
      "text": "或者你要是自己就想变线"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 21.8,
      "end": 22.8,
      "text": "你变不了线"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 22.8,
      "end": 23.36,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 23.36,
      "end": 26.0,
      "text": "因为我们中国的大部分人"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 28.48,
      "text": "从七岁的时候就开始读书了"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 28.48,
      "end": 29.0,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 30.84,
      "text": "你已经打开直播见读书"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 30.84,
      "end": 31.48,
      "text": "谁不会啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 31.48,
      "end": 31.96,
      "text": "谁都会"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 31.96,
      "end": 33.24,
      "text": "你要是折的都能读"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 33.24,
      "end": 34.24,
      "text": "都能赚钱"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 34.24,
      "end": 35.44,
      "text": "没天灵"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 35.44,
      "end": 37.92,
      "text": "这件事情没有任何的互成歌"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 37.92,
      "end": 39.04,
      "text": "而且我跟大家讲"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 39.04,
      "end": 43.96,
      "text": "我们很多人读书的方法都是错的"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 43.96,
      "end": 45.16,
      "text": "然后我先把这个事放在这"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 45.16,
      "end": 46.56,
      "text": "以后告诉大家怎么去做"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 47.76,
      "text": "具体系列怎么做"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 47.76,
      "end": 49.36,
      "text": "我们讲另外一件事情"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 49.36,
      "end": 51.16,
      "text": "就是怎么还能卖东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 51.16,
      "end": 51.36,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 51.36,
      "end": 52.16,
      "text": "你不是卖书吗"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 52.16,
      "end": 52.52,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 52.52,
      "end": 53.12,
      "text": "你要赚线"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 53.12,
      "end": 54.16,
      "text": "变线嘛对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 54.16,
      "end": 55.2,
      "text": "刚才有人问到这个问题"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 55.2,
      "end": 56.36,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 56.36,
      "end": 57.44,
      "text": "那我跟你讲"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 57.44,
      "end": 60.8,
      "text": "我以为说卖东西是最好的方法是什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 60.8,
      "end": 63.8,
      "text": "就是把自己觉得好的东西分享这边"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 63.8,
      "end": 64.08,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 64.08,
      "end": 66.24,
      "text": "比如说我失眠了"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 66.24,
      "end": 67.6,
      "text": "而且我用了一个什么东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 67.6,
      "end": 68.56,
      "text": "真的就不好了"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 68.56,
      "end": 69.72,
      "text": "我分享给你"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 69.72,
      "end": 70.56,
      "text": "对我用了一个战斗"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 70.56,
      "end": 71.72,
      "text": "我的战斗很好"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 71.72,
      "end": 72.0,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 72.0,
      "end": 73.04,
      "text": "要我等我用了什么东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 73.04,
      "end": 73.68,
      "text": "真的很好"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 73.68,
      "end": 74.68,
      "text": "我分享这边"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 74.68,
      "end": 75.96,
      "text": "这一种就是分享"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 75.96,
      "end": 77.12,
      "text": "你不会有任何的些的压力"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 77.12,
      "end": 78.8,
      "text": "而且好东西给别人冰箱"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 78.8,
      "end": 81.4,
      "text": "一定能才能夹着读书也一样"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 81.4,
      "end": 81.8,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 81.8,
      "end": 83.16,
      "text": "但是我们很能现在读书"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 83.16,
      "end": 84.2,
      "text": "变成什么样的"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 84.2,
      "end": 85.32,
      "text": "化条线"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 85.32,
      "end": 86.2,
      "text": "那样的东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 86.2,
      "end": 87.4,
      "text": "然后就指望变线"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 87.4,
      "end": 91.68,
      "text": "你这没有人是为了卖书的"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 91.68,
      "end": 93.0,
      "text": "可能卖书都不理"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 94.04,
      "text": "真的在卖书吗"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 94.04,
      "end": 94.52,
      "text": "不是吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 94.52,
      "end": 95.84,
      "text": "它是为的改变"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 95.84,
      "end": 96.72,
      "text": "当然也有"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 96.72,
      "end": 98.92,
      "text": "很能卖书是为的装飾的"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 98.92,
      "end": 100.4,
      "text": "但是那个没有用的"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 100.4,
      "end": 101.4,
      "text": "化了很多装"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 101.4,
      "end": 102.28,
      "text": "最后里边是超过的"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 102.28,
      "end": 103.44,
      "text": "没有用 对不对"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 103.44,
      "end": 105.84,
      "text": "所以最好的方法是什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 105.84,
      "end": 107.68,
      "text": "各位记住这句话"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 107.68,
      "end": 110.4,
      "text": "人能购买的是改变"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 110.4,
      "end": 112.24,
      "text": "而不是那个书"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 112.24,
      "end": 113.56,
      "text": "所以最好的方法是什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 113.56,
      "end": 114.96,
      "text": "就是你读这边是说"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 114.96,
      "end": 116.16,
      "text": "你改变了"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 116.6,
      "end": 117.4,
      "text": "你像我"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 117.4,
      "end": 118.52,
      "text": "我机会从来没有说"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 118.52,
      "end": 120.04,
      "text": "可是我没什么呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 120.04,
      "end": 120.76,
      "text": "兄弟们"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 120.76,
      "end": 122.36,
      "text": "我只要把书挂在那儿"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 122.36,
      "end": 123.88,
      "text": "我连推的委员员"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 123.88,
      "end": 124.8,
      "text": "人们就会买"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 124.8,
      "end": 125.2,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 125.2,
      "end": 126.68,
      "text": "因为我真的是通过"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 126.68,
      "end": 128.8,
      "text": "读书人生发生了改变"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 128.8,
      "end": 129.4,
      "text": "具体怎么做"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 129.4,
      "end": 130.2,
      "text": "说这么多飞的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 130.2,
      "end": 130.88,
      "text": "告诉你"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 130.88,
      "end": 131.88,
      "text": "就三目"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 131.88,
      "end": 133.28,
      "text": "三目"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 133.28,
      "end": 134.6,
      "text": "认真做啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 134.6,
      "end": 135.12,
      "text": "第一步"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 135.12,
      "end": 136.12,
      "text": "就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 136.12,
      "end": 138.04,
      "text": "每天读书的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 138.04,
      "end": 139.48,
      "text": "不是所有的书都是想不到"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 139.48,
      "end": 140.8,
      "text": "每天必须有"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 140.8,
      "end": 142.16,
      "text": "这么一本书过来"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 142.16,
      "end": 144.32,
      "text": "这么一段书是干嘛的"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 144.32,
      "end": 145.4,
      "text": "不是去记录"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 145.4,
      "end": 146.44,
      "text": "不是这次思考"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 146.44,
      "end": 147.44,
      "text": "不是去记乡"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 147.44,
      "end": 148.36,
      "text": "不是去理解"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 148.36,
      "end": 149.24,
      "text": "就是做"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 149.24,
      "end": 149.8,
      "text": "未来"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 149.8,
      "end": 150.72,
      "text": "四十八个小时"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 150.72,
      "end": 153.08,
      "text": "那你马上给我行动"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 153.08,
      "end": 153.84,
      "text": "就认真怎么办"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 153.84,
      "end": 154.6,
      "text": "就是你行动了"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 154.6,
      "end": 154.88,
      "text": "没有"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 154.88,
      "end": 156.52,
      "text": "而不是你看了多少书"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 156.52,
      "end": 157.52,
      "text": "记得多少比记"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 157.52,
      "end": 158.24,
      "text": "化了多少"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 158.24,
      "end": 158.96,
      "text": "多么好看的"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 158.96,
      "end": 159.64,
      "text": "模特把什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 159.64,
      "end": 161.16,
      "text": "都是什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 161.16,
      "end": 161.72,
      "text": "不重要"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 161.72,
      "end": 163.08,
      "text": "第一件事情"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 163.08,
      "end": 163.64,
      "text": "做"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 163.64,
      "end": 165.24,
      "text": "四百产必须做"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 165.24,
      "end": 166.44,
      "text": "这是第一件事情"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 166.44,
      "end": 167.24,
      "text": "第二件事情"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 167.24,
      "end": 168.08,
      "text": "跟你记住"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 168.08,
      "end": 171.56,
      "text": "如果人真的想发生改变"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 171.56,
      "end": 172.24,
      "text": "这件事"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 172.24,
      "end": 173.84,
      "text": "一定要非常年载"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": 173.84,
      "end": 175.12,
      "text": "如果这个事"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": 175.12,
      "end": 177.8,
      "text": "行动就在很难这事就就别做了"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": 177.8,
      "end": 178.8,
      "text": "就不要做了"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": 178.8,
      "end": 180.6,
      "text": "所以我的建议是什么呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": 180.6,
      "end": 181.64,
      "text": "当你帮你改变的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": 181.64,
      "end": 184.4,
      "text": "一定是把那个事做得很小很小"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": 184.4,
      "end": 186.36,
      "text": "小事记得起来才能成大事"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": 186.36,
      "end": 187.84,
      "text": "昨天每次都是那个力度"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": 187.84,
      "end": 189.08,
      "text": "一定要分裂成为这个小"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": 189.08,
      "end": 190.56,
      "text": "而且我告诉你的方法什么的"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": 190.56,
      "end": 191.28,
      "text": "静好"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": 191.28,
      "end": 194.68,
      "text": "静量副作在你已经成型那个喜欢上"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": 194.68,
      "end": 195.64,
      "text": "比如说你每天都跑步"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": 195.64,
      "end": 197.12,
      "text": "跑步回来以后读书"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": 197.12,
      "end": 198.4,
      "text": "我其实又是这个样子"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": 198.4,
      "end": 198.96,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": 198.96,
      "end": 199.88,
      "text": "每天都刷水"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": 199.88,
      "end": 201.68,
      "text": "刷水平之前读书"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": 201.68,
      "end": 202.48,
      "text": "每天都明击"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": 202.48,
      "end": 204.12,
      "text": "明亮之后读书"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": 204.12,
      "end": 207.96,
      "text": "副作在你必须做某一定会做点事"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": 207.96,
      "end": 209.72,
      "text": "这个事的前面会后面"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "start": 209.72,
      "end": 211.0,
      "text": "来减手摸擦"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "start": 211.0,
      "end": 212.72,
      "text": "另外一个方法是这么大摸擦"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "start": 212.72,
      "end": 214.36,
